    "s31": {
      "id": "s31",
      "kind": "doc",
      "title": "Harbor plan",
      "text": "Plan for the Harbor project, owner Alex.\n## Goals\nInstrument the pier and publish tide data by the end of the month.\n## Timeline\nKickoff on the 20th. Sensors ordered by the 18th. Dock survey on the 25th.\n## Risks\nPermit renewal is slow. Vendor quotes may exceed budget.\n## Checklist\n- [ ] vendor shortlist\n- [x] tide feed access\n- [ ] survey booked\n## Status\nDock survey is blocked by Order pier sensors and Harbor permit renewal.",
      "tags": [],
      "due": null,
      "rev": 5,
      "comments": [
        {
          "id": "c37",
          "by": "sam",
          "text": "Please add a Status section at the end listing what blocks the Dock survey.",
          "resolved": true,
          "replies": [
